    {
      "id": "adversarial-evidence-pending",
      "statement": "The attacker-known evaluation (redact-secret-benchmarks#289) and the #257 promotion-gate reading for evidence-aggregation/v3 are regenerated against the product commit that carries this artifact revision and are pending. The beta.9 record linked from docs/specs/engine.md, 'Maintainer-local shadow evaluation', covers evidence-aggregation/v2 only."
    },
    {
      "id": "poor-generalization",
      "statement": "The #829 selection has development medium-band balanced error 0.049172226340499135 but evaluation balanced error 0.6244338423530675, a generalization gap of 0.5752616160125684; its worst leave-one-category-out balanced error is 0.6666666666666666. This scorer remains shadow-only, non-enforcing and outside the public API. These results are not promotion evidence."
    },
    {
      "id": "q4-structural-at-this-operating-point",
      "statement": "Randomness alone stays below low and context alone reaches medium, so no randomness signal changes an outcome read at medium. The future-promotion Q4 projection reads medium and a statistical candidate without credential-bearing context never reaches it, so Q4 cannot pass at this operating point whichever randomness measure the model uses (#829). Changing the operating point is a calibration decision and a new model identity."
    }
  ],
